@baseUrl = http://localhost:8084/renting

### Search movies by title or genre
GET {{baseUrl}}/peliculas?titulo=Little Women&genero=Drama
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

### Create a movie
POST {{baseUrl}}/peliculas
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "Matrix reloaded",
  "subtitulada": true,
  "estreno": false,
  "genero": { "generoId": 774 },
  "actores": [
    { "actorId": 775 },
    { "actorId": 776 }
  ]
}

### GET GENEROS
GET {{baseUrl}}/generos
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
